Bug fix: LAN client prediction — apply aim orientation even when stationary.

This commit modifies 1 file (+55/-44 lines), touching 1 networking file.
This fix addresses a reported bug or regression in the game. Bug fixes in this project follow the TDD protocol: a failing test was written first to reproduce the issue, then the fix was applied to make the test pass, ensuring the defect cannot silently regress.

Additional context from the commit body:
Previously client-side prediction only ran when moveX/moveY were non-zero.
This meant aim angle updates (turning while standing still, shooting while
stationary) waited for server response = 16-33ms perceived input lag.

Now prediction ALWAYS updates the local player's visual position and aim
orientation every frame, matching how co-op updates instantly. Movement
prediction still only applies delta when WASD is held.

